  "description": "Experience the pinnacle of comfort, convenience, and performance with the FS Pro 3 Cruise—the perfect blend of practicality and luxury for your daily commute or weekend adventures.\nFeatures:\n\n1000W Bafang Ultra M620 Mid-drive Motor: Experience unparalleled power and performance for an exhilarating ride.\n\n160Nm of Torque: Conquer steep hills with ease, thanks to impressive torque output.\n\n265lb Load Capacity: Carry all your gear and essentials effortlessly, without compromise.\n\nOn-Demand Throttle: Enjoy full power when you need it, with convenient throttle control.\n\nCadence+Torque Sensor: Experience smooth and powerful pedal assist for effortless riding.\n\nIncludes one 52V 17Ah Battery (and charger) with the capability to install a second battery: Ride with confidence knowing you have ample power for extended adventures.\n\nOptimized for Comfort and Commuting:\n\nTake advantage of the updated ergonomic cockpit for a comfortable and stylish ride.\nSuper Moto-X tires provide superior grip on pavement and light dirt trails, ensuring a smooth and stable journey every time.\n\nPractical Design Features:\n\nFull coverage rear fenders and rack included, allowing you to load up and hit the road without worrying about dirt or debris.\n\nUnlock the full potential of your daily commute or weekend excursions with the FS Pro 3 Cruise.",
